    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, thanks. Could you go into a bit more detail regarding the specific role of the enzyme alliinase and the subsequent steps? I want to be able to explain to the students exactly how the cell structure being disrupted leads to that sudden, almost \"aggressive\" release of the gas. It feels very instantaneous once the knife hits the surface.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
